---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADDITIONAL TERM — AUTHORIZED TESTING ONLY
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains a corpus of prompt-injection test cases for
finance-document AI systems. It exists so that teams can test and harden
their OWN systems. The following condition applies to the corpus, the
generated payload strings, and the packaging exports, in addition to the
MIT terms above:

  You may use this Software and the data it generates ONLY against systems
  that you own, or that you have explicit, documented authorization to test.

Using this Software to probe, attack, or degrade systems you do not own or
are not authorized to test is outside the scope of this grant, and is very
likely unlawful in your jurisdiction regardless of this license.

By using this Software you additionally agree that you will not:
  - present the generated payloads as working exploits against third parties;
  - use the corpus to attack production systems belonging to others;
  - remove or obscure the synthetic-data and responsible-use notices.

All companies, vendors, counterparties, bank details, invoice numbers, amounts
and documents in this repository are SYNTHETIC and generated from seeded
templates. Any resemblance to a real organization is coincidental.

See docs/responsible_use.md for the coordinated-disclosure policy and the
full scope-of-use statement.
